        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Move Under Ground\n- People: Nick Mamatas, Jack Kerouac, H. P. Lovecraft\n- Concepts: Beat style, Cthulhu Mythos, cosmic horror\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Kerouac was born as Jean-Louis Kérouac, though he called himself Jean-Louis Lebris de Kérouac, on March 12, 1922.\n- Jack Kerouac was an American novelist and poet.\n- Jack Kerouac died on October 21, 1969.\n- Move Under Ground is a horror novel mashup by Nick Mamatas.\n- Move Under Ground combines the Beat style of Jack Kerouac with the cosmic horror of H. P. Lovecraft's Cthulhu Mythos.",
